[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140177610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140177610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140177610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67K07K","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:20:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T14:23:29Z","body":"Nor sure if this is broken, the texture is shared so it's loaded already, and the color is only updated in `_init` so that isn't called until the resource is reloaded, which I don't see that it *should* be until you reload it explicitly, only once there's just one scene will the texture be reloaded with the scene\n\nSo the question is if loaded resources should be recreated when their associated script changes, which I think is a complicated question, it can cause a lot of unforeseen issues if it does","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140177610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140256502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140256502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140256502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67LIL2","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:43:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T14:43:36Z","body":">Nor sure if this is broken, the texture is shared so it's loaded already, and the color is only updated in _init so that isn't called until the resource is reloaded, which I don't see that it should be until you reload it explicitly, only once there's just one scene will the texture be reloaded with the scene\n\nThat said, I don't find a way to reload it explicitly. Perhaps \"Reload Saved Scene\" should reload all scenes, not just the edited one? (Or adding a \"Reload All Scenes\" command). Otherwise it's annoying to have to close other tabs whenever reloading custom resources.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140256502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140268123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140268123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140268123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67LLBb","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:47:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T14:47:01Z","body":"> Perhaps \"Reload Saved Scene\" should reload all scenes\n\nThat would be very surprising, and would prevent you from doing so without saving all open scenes\n\nTo update this I'd say the solution should be to just save the resource, haven't tested this so not sure if that works, if that doesn't work that would be a bug I'd say","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140268123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140281639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140281639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140281639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67LOUn","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:51:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T14:51:03Z","body":">To update this I'd say the solution should be to just save the resource, haven't tested this so not sure if that works, if that doesn't work that would be a bug I'd say\n\nThe custom resource is already saved, it just attachs a script, how can I re-save it?\n\n```tres\n[gd_resource type=\"Texture2D\" script_class=\"MyTexture\" load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://c0jka0klcaj70\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://d1gfilwwmgrx5\" path=\"res://my_tex.gd\" id=\"1_klvgf\"]\n\n[resource]\nresource_local_to_scene = false\nresource_name = \"\"\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_klvgf\")\nmetadata/_custom_type_script = \"uid://d1gfilwwmgrx5\"\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140281639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140286225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140286225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140286225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67LPcR","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:52:24Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T1