":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140329623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109163#issuecomment-3140329623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109163","id":3140329623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67LaCX","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T15:04:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T15:04:53Z","body":"I think this is a very specific edge case that I'm not sure how we would expect to solve, having it reset properties when changing the script would cause user issues, and using a constant that you change is a bit unsafe I'd say, unless this is a specific loading order bug etc. this would probably be expected and the lest surprising behavior in general, to not reset any user content","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140329623/re